  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Support through Data and Capacity Development for Regional Leadership in Transforming Agrifood Systems in the NENA Region.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activities under this Project would contribute towards enhanced capacities of the countries, in NENA region, to develop and implement agriculture and related policies through informed and data-driven decision making. 
The development of the Observatory would contribute towards priorities at the regional level. 
The Observatory and Regional Academy will contribute towards all four Betters, through developing analytical and policy-design capacities</narrative>
  </description>
